WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:05.860
Masamori released a botanical Ayakashi
to test Yoshimori's strength.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.830
Yoshimori created a giant Kekkai
that surrounded the school grounds

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:13.470
and created a back draft
to exterminate the Ayakashi.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.750
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.620
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:30.830
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.730
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.160
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.570
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:44.110
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.440
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:53.110
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.610
Sha la la la la...

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:04.030
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.990
(Secret romance)

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:11.200
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.960
(A strange distance)

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:19.810
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:20.880
Yeah

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.350
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.950
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:33.290
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.510
After creating such a huge Kekkai

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.740
he doesn't even look tired.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:56.470
Crap!

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.110
He just isn't able to control it yet...

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.180
...the overabundant strength inside him.

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:07.220
That's amazing!

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:10.790
You can use that many Shikigami at once?

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.360
Oh. This?

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:13.860
It's no big deal.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.290
Anyone can do this.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.090
You just have to know how to distribute
your energy correctly.

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.560
Oh...

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:23.600
That jerk! He's making
a move on Tokine again!

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.330
- Wait, you-
- Tokine!

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.570
Don't talk to a Sumimura!

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:30.740
Nice move. Grandma Toki!

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.150
- Grandma!
- Good job!

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.650
Hey!

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.820
Don't stop working!

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:45.220
Stop chopping me on the head!
What if you shake my brain?!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:48.400
Silence! You're always almost
causing a disaster!

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.720
One wrong move would have resulted
in a terrible tragedy!

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.360
You need to think about
what you did!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:55.700
I'm trying my best here!

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.300
Listen. Yoshimori.

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.610
You don't seem to understand.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.670
So I'll say it again.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.780
If you continue to be reckless,

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.440
someday you will cause great harm
to the people around you.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.480
Think about that!

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.850
Damn it why is everyone
like this to me?

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:23.860
Is my way wrong?
Am I being naïve?

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.070
What if this place

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:33.440
is taken over by Ayakashi like what
happened to Karasumori in ancient times...

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.540
Hey Sumimura...

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.320
You're awake for once.
Now read the next part.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:44.710
N-Next?

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:46.480
You weren't listening?

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.720
N-No, I was just thinking
of something...

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.520
You were thinking of something
in the middle of my class?

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:53.090
So what were you thinking?

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:58.100
I. Uh... it's...
about risk management.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.120
Or something like that.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:02.430
I see. Risk management
is quite important.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.430
But you know what?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.030
That only matters if you can
do day-to-day things!

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:10.640
Go stand in the hallway with
a bucket on your head!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.280
Come to think of it

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.150
he often made me do training
like this when I was young.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:24.620
Here comes the third one...

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.530
Three?! I can't do it!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:28.680
Concentrate!

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:40.870
Damn! Why do I always remember
things I don't want to?

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.370
Masamori, are you going out?

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.180
Yes. Just for a little.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.210
I cooked up another feast tonight.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.680
I know, let me make you
a bento box!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.440
That's all right, Dad.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.850
O-Oh...

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.200
It seems there is
an organized effort

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.570
to take over Karasumori.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:13.870
Karasumori. Huh?

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.480
No. Nevertheless. I'll leave it at that...

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:30.980
Ketsu!

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.370
Yoshimori!

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.480
I don't know where Masamori is!

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.620
Huh? But I didn't say anything yet!

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:02.420
Every time you start talking to me
like we're close it's always about him!

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.690
Why do you hate Masamori-san?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.490
Isn't it obvious?
Because he's obnoxious.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.200
Don't talk to him anymore!
You'll get his obnoxious germs!

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.730
Don't pass them on to me!
Ew, gross, gross!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.600
O-Obnoxious germs?

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.120
You're such a kid.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.830
You have a respectable,
good brother.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.430
He's kind, smart and strong.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:53.200
Well, I know he's strong.

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:58.610
Oh my... He's always been like this.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.110
Every time I talk about Masamori-san

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:03.520
he gets annoyed and depressed.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:08.210
Is there conflict between siblings
that I just don't understand?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:15.150
Why isn't he the Legitimate Heir?

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:17.660
Hey, Yoshimori!

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:21.260
You better not say that in front
of Masamori-san!

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.800
Yeah. I know that.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:40.750
Considering the forest's rate
of growth yesterday...

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.920
I'm positive the powers of
Karasumori have increased

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:49.060
since I was last here
six or seven years ago.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.330
Hey, Tokine. What do you think about
the Karasumori Site?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.770
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.870
Do you think it's still scary?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:03.240
Well, we've been here for so long...

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:05.840
but I'm becoming more confused
about it recently.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.710
This place is scary.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:13.010
I see...

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:26.860
Ketsu!

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:35.800
This is...

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.670
A Shikigami.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.210
What a mark.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.980
As if it was purposely made
with an incoherent seal.

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.760
Who could it be?

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.630
So they found out... but this...

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.330
This isn't a Kekkaishi of Karasumori.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:13.370
It doesn't seem like any Ayakashi
will come tonight.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.940
Hey, what are you thinking about?

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.650
Madarao. Can you tell where he is?

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.450
Who's "he"?

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:24.890
Masamori.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.280
I don't know.

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:28.860
What do you mean, "you don't know"?

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.690
That man... doesn't have a scent.

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:36.500
It's as if he's wrapped in
a thin film to protect himself.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:39.640
But I know he's close by.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.000
How come?

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:45.240
How long do you think you can keep up
this way of doing things?

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.680
From the way he said that,

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:50.550
he was probably watching us
from somewhere.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:51.980
From where?

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:53.580
Hmm...

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:01.390
There!

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:05.300
That guy!
What is he doing over there?

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.070
Hey!

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:18.810
What are you doing up there?

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.850
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:25.820
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.350
Same to you,
what are you doing here?

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:31.120
Shut up! Just wait!

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.630
I'll get up there!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:33.880
Don't run away!

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.560
That was close.
This is actually pretty hard.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.430
Hey, don't push yourself

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:43.800
if you're not used to using
the Kekkai like that.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:46.640
If you have something to say,
I can come to you.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.600
Shut up! I told you to wait!

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:51.640
Metsu!

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.140
Great job!

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:58.780
You've set yourself apart
from Yoshi again, honey.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:01.350
Oh? Where'd Yoshi go?

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.150
Wasn't he with you?

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:06.980
Yes... but we'll be closing shop
early tonight.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:12.060
There are two Ayakashi in
the direction of the pool.

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:19.970
It's... not... because you told me to,

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.370
but I've been thinking about things.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.880
I know I can't go on like this.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:28.270
And I don't want to think about
the worst case scenario either.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.870
That's why...

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:35.250
I'm thinking of sealing the powers
of Karasumori forever.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.190
Because it is the cause of everything.

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:39.850
What did you say?

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.500
You want to seal Karasumori forever?

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.830
You? And how will you do it?

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:56.330
I'll... think about it, starting now.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:00.010
But I'll become stronger

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:02.480
and take down this mysterious power
of Karasumori!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:05.120
- Don't let your guard down, honey!
- Yeah!

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:07.550
Ketsu!

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:09.880
And all these stupid traditions
we have...

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.180
Metsu!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.320
I'll tear all of it down!

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.500
All of Karasumori! All of it!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.200
One day... definitely, I'll do it!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:31.610
I see. That sounds great.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:32.900
Go ahead and try it.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:34.880
What?

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:37.550
Why are you looking at me
like that?

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:43.550
I thought you'd either
get mad or make fun of me.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.820
Well, I guess Grandfather
would get mad.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.500
You know I'm not
stubborn like him.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:53.330
But!

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:58.770
For 400 years, it has been taboo to
look into the secrets of Karasumori.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:04.310
You never know what might happen
if things go badly.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.340
It's a dangerous region
filled with mystery.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.240
Do you understand that?

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.080
Y-Yeah...

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.510
But don't you think it's weird?

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.360
We're told to protect Karasumori,

00:13:17.390 --> 00:13:19.790
but we're not allowed
to know about it.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:21.890
It's not weird.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:26.930
Historically, things that were sacred
were things that had to be kept pure.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:36.170
Commoners weren't allowed
to see. Hear. Or come close...

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:39.480
It's the same around the world.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:44.850
Those who ventured to approach the gods
have always been punished.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:46.580
Gods?

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:51.220
Anyways, good luck.
I have other things to do.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.690
- Wait!
- I'll see you later.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.120
That Shikigami...

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.760
There should be more than one.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.270
If I can find evidence...

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:09.240
Kurohime.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.810
I need to check on some things.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:14.980
I'm going to expand the shadow.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:19.210
It might be hard,
but you must search the entire town.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.850
Flush out all foreign objects.

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:38.670
This is Sumimura's...

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:49.310
Masamori... what is he?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:01.520
Ketsu!

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:05.190
Metsu!

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:06.960
Tenketsu!

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:15.640
Oh no... again!

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:18.240
It's Mas-san.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:22.850
Wow he's pretty good.

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:29.350
W-What is this?

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:49.180
I see. So there's another one
at the eastern edge.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.770
Let's hunt it down.

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:52.340
Wait!

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:57.310
Stupid brother! Whoops!

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.640
Hey! What's this creepy feeling?!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.620
You did it, didn't you?!

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:06.320
Is that another kind of Kekkai?

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.160
You're not ready for it yet.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.790
Hey! Wait!

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:21.340
Please wait... Brother...

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.840
I'm surprised.
I didn't expect him to be this powerful.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:33.280
Oh well.

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:36.880
A makeshift Shikigami like that
would have been caught eventually...

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:54.600
Ketsu!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.170
I was too late.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:08.350
For a moment
I felt the presence of an Ayakashi.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.480
But Ayakashi shouldn't
be able to use a Shikigami.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.890
Is the Caster a human?
Or is it an Ayakashi?

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.430
The ones who are after Karasumori...

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:24.940
It would be wise to investigate this
from a different angle.

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:52.160
You have talent.
Mastering the techniques isn't a bad thing.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:56.230
I'm not telling you to return to an
ordinary life.

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.730
But you must act in moderation!

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:00.370
To lose oneself in the pursuit
of mastering techniques...

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:04.110
I know.
I still have much to learn.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:07.470
I don't even compare to you, Grandfather.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.950
Do you still frequent
the main headquarters?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.490
It is the same with being
the chief of the Night Troops.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.560
You should not become too involved
with the Shadow Organization!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.360
You should limit yourself to only

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.230
receiving work and information
from them.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:30.070
That organization isn't
what it used to be.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.630
You would be fine on your own.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:37.540
It's all right. I keep my distance.

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:43.540
I will be leaving tonight.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.050
What? Already?

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:47.820
I have work to catch up on.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:49.780
Say, Masamori...

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.190
I know it may be
uncomfortable for you...

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.150
...but why don't you
come back home?

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.370
If you are here,
there is so much you can do...

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:04.230
That fool is just too unreliable.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.660
Masamori?

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:10.070
He's much better than I am.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.180
You already know that, Grandfather.

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:26.190
Here's your bento box.
And here's your drink.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:27.480
All this?

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:29.590
Thanks. Dad.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.200
Masa, when are you going
to come back again?

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.590
Take care.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:35.690
Hey.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.800
I have a favor to ask you.

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:40.000
Oh? What's that?

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.160
This...

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:46.240
That's some fur from
an Ayakashi.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:47.340
Yeah.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.750
It's an Ayakashi named Koya.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.350
He used to be Madarao's friend
from long ago.

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:59.190
Can you give this a proper burial?

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:08.630
He really wanted to return to the mountain
where he was born and raised.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.470
You're such a kind person.

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:18.370
I promised... his friends.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:27.620
And that mountain seems to have
been sealed by the founder,

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:28.990
long ago...

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.550
By Hazama Tokimori?

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:34.550
I thought you would be able
to do something about it.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.960
I can't leave this place.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.130
Oh? All right.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.800
You do your best okay?

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:52.800
Bye!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.570
Bye!

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.780
Be sure to continue with
your training!

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.780
One day... one day...

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.090
I will surpass you!

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.660
Welcome back. Chief.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:17.200
I doubt that you can find out
who right away,

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.860
but I'll give this to you anyway.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.070
Yessir.

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:23.810
What? Masamori-san already left?

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.770
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:28.370
Shut up! That's none of your business!

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.110
What do you mean by that?!

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:33.750
Man! I was going to
get Masamori-san to teach me

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.850
about techniques and a whole bunch
of other stuff!

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:37.210
A whole bunch of other stuff?!

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.220
He was amazing.

00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:40.660
I couldn't believe the way
he used the techniques!

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:42.890
I wish I could see it again!

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:46.460
Damn! What's there to like about
that bearded bald dude?

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.960
Is it the beard? Is it the beard?!

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:53.000
Oh. I wish I had
an older brother like that.

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:58.970
If I keep talking like this
Yoshimori might sulk again.

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:00.710
I guess I should stop here...

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:05.810
Just you wait Tokine.

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:09.920
I'll surpass my brother
and one day...

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:12.520
I'll seal the Karasumori Site.

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:17.960
I'd prefer having an older sister
rather than an older brother.

00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:19.330
You're such a...

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:24.440
That way we'll never
have to think about the techniques.

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:29.560
That way neither you nor anybody else...
will ever get hurt.

00:22:39.890 --> 00:22:47.590
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:54.300
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:55.870 --> 00:23:03.680
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:10.010
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:19.860
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:26.220
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:35.310
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:42.840
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:51.830
Even if we are near or far

00:23:51.830 --> 00:24:00.390
The red string connects one to another
